        "created_at": "2011-09-12T03:23:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What’s not to love about this game? It’s got everything: It’s cooperative, it’s got varying levels of complexity, it’s got strategy, it’s got funnies, it’s got killer artwork, and it plays as fast or slow as your intellect and knowledge of the game allow. This was by far heads above all the rest my best purchase at Gencon, 2011.</p>\n<p>-nihil</p>",
